{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0008139 nuclear localization sequence binding' & replace by nucleocytoplasmic carrier activity (GO:0140142), see https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31419\n\nAnnotations are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NLoo-WPT-6YpYDKVbUqrOHZSnOkIbDVtj4OB2s5Cx3M/edit?gid=779903919#gid=779903919\n\nUniProt | 10\nSGD | 7\nRGD | 6\nPINC | 5\nFlyBase | 2\nParkinsonsUK-UCL | 2 - done\nMGI | 1\n~PomBase | 1~ DONE\n\n\n\n1 mapping to InterPro:IPR024882 Nucleoporin p58/p45/NUP49 > GO:nuclear localization sequence binding ; GO:0008139\nUsed in FYPO : FYPO:0007070 | UPHENO:0000001 | UbergraphImplementation | None | UsageContext.RELATIONSHIP_OBJECT\n", "created_at": "2026-05-27T14:48:20Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0008139 nuclear localization sequence binding", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-06-18T13:10:59Z"}
